--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components bundled with this distribution
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

* cpp/third_party/stb_image.h — stb_image v2.x by Sean Barrett and contributors.
  Dual-licensed under the MIT License and the Public Domain (Unlicense); see the
  license block at the end of that file. Vendored unmodified.

External dependencies that are NOT distributed with this software and must be
obtained separately under their own terms:

* IPOPT (EPL-2.0) and its bundled MUMPS linear solver.
* HSL MA57 / MA97 (proprietary; free for academic use under the HSL licence,
  https://licences.stfc.ac.uk/product/coin-hsl). The build links against these
  but does not include them.
* The bundled test image (images/cameraman.png) is the classic "cameraman"
  photograph, a standard image-processing benchmark in wide public circulation.
